{
  "uid": "otel-training-service",
  "title": "Vue service — Formation OTel",
  "tags": ["otel-training"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service_name",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "webstore-metrics" },
        "query": "label_values(traces_span_metrics_calls_total, service_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": { "text": "review-service", "value": "review-service" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Débit de requêtes — $service_name",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "webstore-metrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Latence p95 (ms) — $service_name",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "webstore-metrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[2m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Logs — $service_name",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-opensearch-datasource", "uid": "webstore-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "query": "resource.service.name:\"$service_name\"",
          "queryType": "lucene",
          "metrics": [{ "id": "1", "type": "logs" }],
          "bucketAggs": []
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Traces récentes — $service_name",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "webstore-traces" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "$service_name",
          "limit": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Bonus 1 — Seuil d'alerte : p95 > 500 ms — $service_name",
      "description": "Le même p95 que le panel 2, avec le seuil d'alerte matérialisé. C'est de ce panel que part 'New alert rule' : la ligne rouge est la condition, la durée du dépassement est le 'for' de la règle.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "webstore-metrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[2m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed+area" } },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 500 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Bonus 2 — Exemplars : p95 gRPC serveur (métriques SDK, tous services)",
      "description": "Ne suit pas la variable $service_name, et c'est volontaire : les exemplars viennent des SDK des applications, que tous les services n'exposent pas. Les métriques traces_span_metrics_* de spanmetrics n'en portent aucun. Cliquez un marqueur sous la courbe pour ouvrir la trace dans Jaeger.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "webstore-metrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le) (rate(rpc_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 (SDK)",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] }
    }
  ]
}
